  {
    "body": {
      "text": "Tool Proficiency If you have proficiency with a tool, add your Proficiency Bonus to any ability check you make that uses the tool. If you have proficiency in a skill that’s used with that check, you have Advantage on the check too. Your features might give you proficiency with a tool. A monster has proficiency with any tool in its stat block."
